# Local-only developer material: the root build-profile.json5 carries
# DevEco's auto-generated signing config (absolute paths to ~/.ohos material
# plus encrypted key/store passwords), so the file stays tracked with an empty
# signingConfigs and local edits are hidden via:
#   git update-index --skip-worktree build-profile.json5
# Debug payloads kept out of the repo (see AUTH_FORM_FILL_JS):
/dev-progress/local/
